---
layout: base.njk
permalink: tym.html
canonicalPath: /tym.html
title: Náš tým | STAN Praha 13
description: Tým Starostů a nezávislých pro Prahu 13.
navKey: team
---
{% set visibleCandidates = candidates | visible %}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Seznamte se s naším týmem</h1>
    <p>Zkušenosti, odbornost i mladá energie. Jsme lidé, kteří na Třináctce žijí a chtějí ji společně posunout dál.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-main team-page-main">
  <div class="container page-panel">
    <div class="candidate-stack">
      {% for candidate in visibleCandidates %}
      {% if candidate.featured %}
      <article class="candidate-profile reveal">
        <div class="candidate-portrait-zone candidate-color-{{ candidate.color }}">
          <img class="candidate-cutout" src="{{ candidate.image }}" alt="{{ candidate.name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="candidate-copy">
          <span class="candidate-number">{{ candidate.positionLabel }}</span>
          <h3>{{ candidate.name }}</h3>
          <p class="candidate-role">{{ candidate.role }}</p>
          <p class="candidate-annotation">{{ candidate.annotation }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="compact-candidates-section">
      <div class="section-title compact-section-title">
        <h2>Kandidáti 8–35</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="compact-candidates-grid" role="group" aria-label="Kandidáti 8 až 35">
        {% for candidate in visibleCandidates %}
        {% if not candidate.featured %}
        <article class="compact-candidate">
          <div class="compact-avatar">{{ candidate.number }}</div>
          {% if candidate.name %}
          <div class="compact-candidate-info"><strong>{{ candidate.name }}</strong>{% if candidate.role %}<span>{{ candidate.role }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="compact-candidate-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
